  "Dataset Description": {
    "@value": "Entirely synthetic participant-level dataset for a 12-week, two-arm randomized pilot study of a 10-hour time-restricted eating window versus habitual eating in 40 adults aged 40–65 years with prediabetes. Variables cover enrollment, demographics, study arm, fasting glucose, HbA1c, BMI, systolic blood pressure, medication, safety, completion, adherence, and persistent identifiers."
  },
